  "releaseNotes": "Uses transient native Cocoa windows for macOS menus, context menus, drop-downs, and other WPF popups with normalized owner-relative input, capture, placement, movement, and click handling; retains native X11 popup windows and the Wayland owner-surface path, the native Windows OLE clipboard round-trip gate, typed windowing and allows-transparency diagnostics, and SharpDevelop Project Explorer double-click acceptance; and remains pinned to immutable ProGPU preview.30.",
